1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:11,923
Associated Press reports that France has approved a broad ban on social media for children under 15, the first such national measure in the European Union.

2
00:00:11,873 --> 00:00:16,844
Supporters say it protects young people from harmful online content.

3
00:00:16,844 --> 00:00:24,608
Critics warn that age checks may threaten privacy and could be difficult to enforce before the new school year.

